},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"披露した曲は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4140729/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前髪変わったのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー！ライブもうすぐだあ><‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は勉強になった日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4140729/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソースでにこちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描いたメンチカツ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4140729/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい作"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も笑顔で頑張りまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9131":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごってぃーぴょーんぬ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごってぃ(川後陽菜chan)ですねー\n写真はマンフリの時のですねー\nひめたんいろいろあってパジャマだけど\nまっ気にしないでねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"き、気にしないでね///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は収録があった(・∀・)よ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆーと次のセリフは決まって\n「詳しくはオンエアをお楽しみにー」\nしか言えないんだけどねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあれだなー\nテスト週間だったから\nみんなととうぶん会ってなかったから\n全員集合は嬉しかったな∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋はなんかね\nいかしたマッサージチェアとかあってね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯がカジキマグロさんだったんだけど\nそいつの上にのってる大根おろしが\nまーなかなか美味だったねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのじもとーくとかね\n楽しかったのー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ\n公式サイトに\n指望遠鏡・春のメロディーのPV\nあがってたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度撮影のエピソード書きまっすー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスカードも\nよかったら応募してみてね(*>ω<*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスとかにひめたんにプレゼント持ってたら迷惑かな？\nまったく迷惑じゃないよ♪\nもしかしてあなたがいつも中元家に来る\nサンタさんなのね(｀・ω・´)るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビーム誕生秘話ってないの？\n日芽香は目が合うと反らせないよね！\nって乃木ここの中で言われて\nひめたんビームって名前は\nあしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)が付けたかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日頃、健康に気をつけている事を教えてください。\nおうちから会社まで歩いてる！どや\n所有時間はあえてかかないー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近女子力アップのためになんかやってる？\nアプリでお姫さま育ててる(*>ω<*)笑\nあ半身浴とかしてます←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ハマってる食べ物ってありますか？\nばなな豆乳∩^ω^∩うましうまし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ごまきな粉プリンは好きですか？\n美味しそうねー\n食べたことないけどきっとすっきー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの、この冬一押しの鍋料理は、なんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはどんな鍋が好き？\n去年は、カレーチーズ鍋が美味しかった記憶があるかなー\n牡蠣の土手鍋も美味しいからね(^^)\n広島行く人はぜひ食べてみてねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは年越しそば派？うどん派？それともラーメン派？\nそば(｀・ω・´)\nそこはそばですよ。そばしかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おせちの好きな具といえば？\n栗きんとん＊だし巻きたまご＊\n目がぎょろってなってる海老さん怖いから目合わせないようにする(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントっていつどこで読む事が多い?\n学校やら会社やらの帰り道かな。\nあとは半身浴しながらとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お絵描きしてみたー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8463349/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}}